0	section	Talking to Lady Keli
1	line	Player	Are you the famous Lady Keli? Leader of the toughest gang of bandits around?
1	line	Lady Keli	Yes, I am Keli. You've heard of me then?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Heard of you? You're famous in Gielinor!
2	line	Player	Heard of you? You're famous in Gielinor!
2	line	Lady Keli	That's very kind of you to say. Reputations are not easily earned. I have managed to succeed where many fail.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	I think Katrine is still tougher.
3	line	Player	I think Katrine is still tougher.
3	line	Lady Keli	Well you can think that all you like! Those cowards dare not leave Varrock. Out here, I'm toughest. You can tell them that! Now get out of my sight, before I call my guards.
3	action	end
2	option	What's your latest plan then?
3	line	Player	What's your latest plan then?
3	line	Lady Keli	Why do you want to know?
3	line	Player	Well I was actually hoping to join your group.
3	line	Lady Keli	Join us? Interesting... I suppose you do look the type.
3	line	Lady Keli	You'll of course need to properly prove yourself before we let you join us. However, what I can tell you is that we currently have a very valuable prisoner. If all goes well, he will make us very rich.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Ah, I see. You must have been very skillful.
4	line	Player	Ah, I see. You must have been very skillful.
4	line	Lady Keli	To catch him? Oh yes. We had to grab him without his bodyguards noticing. It was a stroke of genius. Mostly my doing, of course.
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	How do you know someone won't try to free him?
5	action	below
4	option	Well good luck with it.
5	action	below
3	option	How do you know someone won't try to free him?
4	line	Player	How do you know someone won't try to free him?
4	line	Lady Keli	There is no way to release him. The only key to his cell is on a chain around my neck, and the locksmith who made it died very suddenly.
4	line	Lady Keli	There isn't another key like this in the world.
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	Could I see the key please?
5	line	Player	Could I see the key please?
5	line	Lady Keli	Why?
5	line	Player	It will be something I can tell my grandchildren, when you are even more famous than you are now.
5	line	Lady Keli	Well I suppose there's no harm in letting you see it. After all, you have no hope of stealing it.
5	box	Keli shows you a small key on a strong looking chain.
